  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 12989173760
    m_Localized: Once upon a time there lived a ninja in these lands. Her biggest
      dream was to become an avatar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1756857953095680
    m_Localized: His master told him about the Dragon Ball. The person who obtained
      the Dragon Ball would master the 4 elements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1757440957157376
    m_Localized: His master told him, "The only way to become an Avatar is to have
      the Dragon Ball."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1757444224520192
    m_Localized: This ninja decided to find the Dragon Ball and went on an adventure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1758137907875840
